        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:12.973Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The primary goals of the new collaboration, announced at the Google for Health Summit in Singapore, are to accelerate scientific discoveries, transform clinical care delivery, and empower Singaporeans with proactive health tools.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/health/google-for-health-summit-singapore/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:12.973Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To advance scientific research, Google.org and Google DeepMind are contributing $7 million to the Philanthropy Asia Alliance’s Health for Human Potential Coalition.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/health/google-for-health-summit-singapore/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:12.973Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This includes $1 million for PathGen , an AI platform that uses Google technology to help countries detect disease threats faster and share data for public health intelligence while protecting in-country data sovereignty.",
