        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:12.973Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Additionally, Google Cloud is partnering with NHG Health on a population health program that uses AI-driven predictive insights to forecast health risks, such as chronic conditions, across sub-populations.",
